  "notes": "{望|のぞ}む has two main meanings: to desire/hope for, and to look out on.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle for the object of desire or view\n\nSENSE 1 - DESIRE:\n- ⟦{平和|へいわ}→平和：01507_heiwa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{望|のぞ}む: to desire peace\n- ⟦{成功|せいこう}→成功：02638_seikou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{望|のぞ}む: to hope for success\n- ⟦{望|のぞ}み→望み：03543_nozomi⟧⟦{通|どお}り→どおり：09884_doori⟧: as desired, as wished\n\nSENSE 2 - VIEW:\n- ⟦{海|うみ}→海：00556_umi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{望|のぞ}む: to overlook the sea\n- ⟦{山|やま}→山：02168_yama⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{望|のぞ}む⟦{部屋|へや}→部屋：00507_heya⟧: a room with a mountain view\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{望|のぞ}み→望み：03543_nozomi⟧: hope, wish (noun)\n- ⟦{希望|きぼう}→希望：00221_kibou⟧: hope, wish (more common)\n- ⟦{願|ねが}う→願う：02387_negau⟧: to wish, pray\n\nFORMAL USAGE:\nお{望|のぞ}み⟦{通|どお}り→どおり：09884_doori⟧ and お⟦{望|のぞ}み→望み：03543_nozomi⟧でしたら are polite expressions meaning \"as you wish\" and \"if you desire.\"",
